<div id="stage">
  <canvas id="view"></canvas>
  <div id="alerts" class="create-alerts" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <header class="create-bar">
    <strong id="worldName"></strong>
    <span id="hud"></span>
  </header>
</div>
<aside id="side">
  <section class="create-pick">
    <button type="button" class="create-help" popovertarget="help">help</button>
    <div class="create-work" role="group" aria-label="type of work">
      <button type="button" data-work="manage" aria-pressed="false">manage</button>
      <button type="button" data-work="planning" data-key="t" aria-pressed="false">planning<kbd class="create-key">T</kbd></button>
      <button type="button" data-work="geo" data-key="g" aria-pressed="true">geo<kbd class="create-key">G</kbd></button>
      <button type="button" data-work="build" data-key="y" aria-pressed="false">build<kbd class="create-key">Y</kbd></button>
      <button type="button" data-work="caves" data-key="i" aria-pressed="false">caves<kbd class="create-key">I</kbd></button>
    </div>
    <div class="create-tools create-manage" data-work="manage" hidden>
      <button id="openWorld" type="button">upload world</button>
      <button id="downloadWorld" type="button">download world</button>
      <button id="newWorld" type="button" title="an empty world, all sea">new world</button>
      <a class="create-page-link" href="/objects">objects</a>
      <a class="create-page-link" href="/classes">classes</a>
      <section class="create-repo" aria-label="spawn point">
        <h3>Spawn point</h3>
        <p id="spawnAt"></p>
        <button id="spawnHere" type="button" title="characters new to the world start where the builder stands">spawn here</button>
        <button id="spawnGo" type="button">go to the spawn point</button>
      </section>
      <section class="create-repo" aria-label="GitHub">
        <h3>GitHub</h3>
        <p id="repoSource"></p>
        <form id="repoOpen"><input placeholder="owner/repo" aria-label="GitHub repo" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit">open repo</button></form>
        <input id="repoMessage" placeholder="what you changed" aria-label="commit message" autocomplete="off">
        <button id="repoSave" type="button" title="commit what's changed to the repo's branch">save to GitHub</button>
        <button id="repoPublish" type="button" title="tag the saved commit as the next version">publish version</button>
        <p id="repoStatus" role="status"></p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="create-tools" data-work="planning" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-tool="select" data-key="h" aria-pressed="false" title="select lines and pins, to move or delete them">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18 C 12 4, 20 22, 30 10 S 42 6, 45 14" fill="none" stroke="#ffe14d" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M3 18 C 12 4, 20 22, 30 10 S 42 6, 45 14" fill="none" stroke="#ff5a36" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>select</span><kbd class="create-key">H</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="marker" data-key="j" aria-pressed="false" title="draw lines on the ground">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18 C 12 4, 20 22, 30 10 S 42 6, 45 14" fill="none" stroke="#ff5a36" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>marker</span><kbd class="create-key">J</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="eraser" data-key="k" aria-pressed="false" title="erase lines">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18 C 10 8, 14 14, 18 12 M30 11 C 36 8, 42 6, 45 14" fill="none" stroke="#ff5a36" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="12" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#ddd" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
        <span>eraser</span><kbd class="create-key">K</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="pin" data-key="n" aria-pressed="false" title="stick pins in the map, with notes">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="24" y1="9" x2="24" y2="23" stroke="#d8d4cc" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="24" cy="7" r="5" fill="#e8202a"/></svg>
        <span>pin</span><kbd class="create-key">N</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="measure" data-key="m" aria-pressed="false" title="measure distances and circles">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16 L44 16 M4 10 L4 22 M24 12 L24 20 M14 14 L14 18 M34 14 L34 18 M44 10 L44 22" fill="none" stroke="#ffe9a0" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <span>measure</span><kbd class="create-key">M</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="path" data-key="l" aria-pressed="false" title="find the shortest way on foot from one place to another">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 C 14 18, 14 6, 24 8 C 32 10, 32 16, 42 6" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3" fill="#ffe9a0"/><circle cx="42" cy="6" r="3" fill="#ffe9a0"/></svg>
        <span>path</span><kbd class="create-key">L</kbd>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="create-tools" data-work="build" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-tool="pick" data-key="h" aria-pressed="false" title="pick objects and slabs, to move, turn, delete or make a template of">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="6" width="14" height="12" fill="#b08a5a"/><circle cx="34" cy="13" r="6" fill="#8a8a80"/><rect x="4" y="3" width="40" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#ffe14d" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/></svg>
        <span>select</span><kbd class="create-key">H</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="object" data-key="j" aria-pressed="false" title="place objects">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L46 22" stroke="#c8b48a" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M14 22 L18 8 L30 8 L34 22 Z" fill="#8a8a80"/><path d="M20 8 L24 3 L28 8 Z" fill="#6d6d64"/></svg>
        <span>object</span><kbd class="create-key">J</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="template" data-key="k" aria-pressed="false" title="place templates: slabs and objects saved together">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L46 22" stroke="#c8b48a" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 22 L8 12 L18 5 L28 12 L28 22 Z" fill="#b08a5a"/><path d="M5 13 L18 3 L31 13" fill="none" stroke="#7a4a2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="38" cy="18" r="4" fill="#8a8a80"/></svg>
        <span>template</span><kbd class="create-key">K</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="slab" data-key="l" aria-pressed="false" title="draw floors, walls, rooms and roofs">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 20 L30 20 L42 14 L18 14 Z" fill="#b08a5a"/><path d="M18 14 L18 4 L42 4 L42 14 Z" fill="#a09080"/></svg>
        <span>slab</span><kbd class="create-key">L</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="stairs" data-key="m" aria-pressed="false" title="draw stairs">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22 L6 18 L14 18 L14 14 L22 14 L22 10 L30 10 L30 6 L42 6 L42 22 Z" fill="#b08a5a"/></svg>
        <span>stairs</span><kbd class="create-key">M</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="ramp" data-key="n" aria-pressed="false" title="draw ramps">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22 L30 6 L42 6 L42 22 Z" fill="#a09080"/></svg>
        <span>ramp</span><kbd class="create-key">N</kbd>
      </button>
    </div>
    <section class="create-cave-system" data-work="caves" aria-label="cave network" hidden>
      <p class="create-cave-name"><strong id="caveNet">no network</strong> <span id="cavePhase"></span></p>
      <p id="caveCounts" class="create-note"></p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="cavePhaseSwitch" title="layout regenerates the network from its points; polish lets you edit its rock by hand">start polishing</button>
        <button type="button" id="caveUndo" title="undo the last cave change (ctrl+z)">undo</button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-way">
        <input id="caveRename" type="text" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder="rename to" aria-label="rename the network">
      </div>
      <div class="create-cave-view">
        <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="rock drawn">
          <button type="button" data-cave-view="finished" aria-pressed="true" title="the rock as players see it (` switches)">finished<kbd class="create-key">`</kbd></button>
          <button type="button" data-cave-view="blocks" aria-pressed="false" title="the rock's 2 ft blocks (` switches)">blocks<kbd class="create-key">`</kbd></button>
        </div>
        <label class="create-check" title="the networks' points, entrances and the lines between"><input type="checkbox" id="caveLayoutShown"> layout</label>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="create-tools" data-work="caves" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveSelect" data-key="h" aria-pressed="false" title="select a cave's points and entrances, to see or change them">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 16 L22 12 L42 14" stroke="#4da6ff" stroke-width="1" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="12" r="3.5" fill="#ffe14d"/><rect x="14" y="4" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#ffe14d" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 2"/></svg>
        <span>select</span><kbd class="create-key">H</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="entrance" data-key="j" aria-pressed="false" title="place an entrance into a hillside, from above the ground, starting or joining a cave network">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 22 L24 4 L44 22" stroke="#a09080" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M18 22 L18 15 A6 6 0 0 1 30 15 L30 22" stroke="#7fffe6" stroke-width="2" fill="#203040"/></svg>
        <span>place entrance</span><kbd class="create-key">J</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveAdd" data-key="k" data-phase="layout" aria-pressed="false" title="add passages from inside a cave, where you look">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 16 L22 12 L42 14" stroke="#4da6ff" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><circle cx="22" cy="12" r="3" stroke="#4da6ff" stroke-width="2" fill="#203040"/><path d="M36 20 L36 10 A6 6 0 0 1 48 10" stroke="#4da6ff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" fill="none"/></svg>
        <span>add</span><kbd class="create-key">K</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveBlocks" data-key="k" data-phase="polish" aria-pressed="false" title="break blocks with a click, place them with a right-click">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="10" y="10" width="8" height="8" stroke="#a09080" stroke-width="1.5" fill="#203040"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="8" height="8" stroke="#a09080" stroke-width="1.5" fill="#203040"/><rect x="18" y="2" width="8" height="8" stroke="#7fffe6" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" fill="none"/><path d="M30 20 L40 6" stroke="#c8d4e8" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <span>blocks</span><kbd class="create-key">K</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveSculpt" data-key="l" data-phase="polish" aria-pressed="false" title="carve with a shape, or fill with a right-click">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="8" stroke="#7fffe6" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" fill="#203040"/><path d="M30 20 L40 6" stroke="#c8d4e8" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <span>sculpt</span><kbd class="create-key">L</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveSmooth" data-key="u" data-phase="polish" aria-pressed="false" title="fill small hollows and knock off bumps">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18 L12 18 L12 14 L20 14 L20 18 L28 18 L28 10 L36 10 L36 18 L44 18" stroke="#a09080" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M4 17 C 16 14, 30 13, 44 16" stroke="#7fffe6" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/></svg>
        <span>smooth</span><kbd class="create-key">U</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="caveFlatten" data-key="o" data-phase="polish" aria-pressed="false" title="level floors, looking down, or ceilings, looking up, to where you began">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18 L14 18 L14 12 L24 12 L24 16 L44 16" stroke="#a09080" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M4 14 L44 14" stroke="#7fffe6" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <span>flatten</span><kbd class="create-key">O</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="cavePaint" data-key="p" data-phase="polish" aria-pressed="false" title="change the rock, not its shape">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="12" width="24" height="8" fill="#8a7a66"/><rect x="6" y="12" width="12" height="8" fill="#b0a088"/><path d="M34 4 L26 14" stroke="#c8d4e8" stroke-width="3"/></svg>
        <span>paint</span><kbd class="create-key">P</kbd>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="create-tools" data-work="geo">
      <button type="button" data-tool="raise" data-key="h" aria-pressed="false" title="raise and lower the ground">
        <canvas width="48" height="24" data-shape="round"></canvas>
        <span>raise/lower</span><kbd class="create-key">H</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="flatten" data-key="j" aria-pressed="false" title="flatten the ground to where you began">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 16 C 8 6, 12 18, 16 10 L32 10 C 36 16, 40 4, 46 14 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/></svg>
        <span>flatten</span><kbd class="create-key">J</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="smooth" data-key="k" aria-pressed="false" title="smooth the ground">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 14 C 14 6, 34 6, 46 14 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/></svg>
        <span>smooth</span><kbd class="create-key">K</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="noise" data-key="u" aria-pressed="false" title="roughen the ground with lumps">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 14 L6 11 L9 15 L13 9 L17 13 L20 10 L24 14 L28 8 L31 12 L35 10 L39 15 L43 11 L46 14 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/></svg>
        <span>noise</span><kbd class="create-key">U</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="draw" data-key="l" aria-pressed="false" title="draw a line to grow hills, mountains or a cliff along">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 18 C 8 16, 10 8, 16 9 C 22 10, 24 4, 30 6 C 36 8, 40 14, 46 16 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/><path d="M3 21 C 14 19, 30 21, 45 19" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>draw</span><kbd class="create-key">L</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="biomes" data-key="n" aria-pressed="false" title="draw areas of each biome">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20 L10 4 L24 7 L22 20 Z" fill="#2e7d32" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M24 7 L42 3 L45 18 L22 20 Z" fill="#9e9488" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1"/></svg>
        <span>biomes</span><kbd class="create-key">N</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="water" data-key="b" aria-pressed="false" title="draw lakes, ponds and swamp pools">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 10 C 8 8, 10 14, 14 14 L34 14 C 38 14, 40 8, 46 10 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/><path d="M12 14 L36 14 C 34 19, 14 19, 12 14 Z" fill="#3a78b8"/></svg>
        <span>water</span><kbd class="create-key">B</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="pools" data-key="p" aria-pressed="false" title="scatter small pools, for swamps and marshes">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 12 L46 12 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/><ellipse cx="10" cy="16" rx="5" ry="2" fill="#6d7a3c"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="19" rx="7" ry="2.5" fill="#6d7a3c"/><ellipse cx="37" cy="15" rx="4" ry="1.5" fill="#6d7a3c"/><ellipse cx="40" cy="20" rx="3" ry="1.2" fill="#6d7a3c"/></svg>
        <span>pools</span><kbd class="create-key">P</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="courses" data-key="r" aria-pressed="false" title="draw streams and rivers">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 12 L46 12 L46 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/><path d="M4 18 C 14 12, 20 22, 30 16 C 36 12, 40 16, 44 14" fill="none" stroke="#3a78b8" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>courses</span><kbd class="create-key">R</kbd>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-tool="clear" aria-pressed="false" title="clear the ground away, back to empty sea">
        <svg width="48" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 L2 14 C 6 8, 10 12, 14 10 L14 22 Z M34 10 C 38 12, 42 8, 46 14 L46 22 L34 22 Z" fill="#c8b48a"/><path d="M14 22 L14 18 L34 18 L34 22 Z" fill="#2e608c"/></svg>
        <span>clear</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="create-config">
    <div data-config="none">
      <p class="create-note">Pick a tool.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-config="marker" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Drag on the ground to draw a line, up to 8 miles long.</p>
      <p class="create-note" id="strokeLength"></p>
      <div class="create-swatches" role="group" aria-label="color">
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="black" aria-pressed="false" title="black"><span style="background:#000000"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="white" aria-pressed="false" title="white"><span style="background:#ffffff"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="red" aria-pressed="true" title="red"><span style="background:#e8202a"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="dark orange" aria-pressed="false" title="dark orange"><span style="background:#ff8c00"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="bright green" aria-pressed="false" title="bright green"><span style="background:#30f030"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="magenta" aria-pressed="false" title="magenta"><span style="background:#ff00ff"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="gray" aria-pressed="false" title="gray"><span style="background:#808080"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-color="pink" aria-pressed="false" title="pink"><span style="background:#ff9ec8"></span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-styles" role="group" aria-label="style">
        <button type="button" data-pen-style="solid" aria-pressed="true" title="solid"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-style="dashed" aria-pressed="false" title="dashed"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="7 4"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-style="dotted" aria-pressed="false" title="dotted"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/></svg></button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-widths" role="group" aria-label="width">
        <button type="button" data-pen-width="1" aria-pressed="false" title="width 1"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-width="2" aria-pressed="true" title="width 2"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-width="3" aria-pressed="false" title="width 3"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-pen-width="4" aria-pressed="false" title="width 4"><svg width="32" height="12" viewBox="0 0 32 12" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="29" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="pin" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click the ground to stick a pin in it, and give it a title and notes. Click a pin's head to open it again.</p>
      <div class="create-swatches" role="group" aria-label="head color">
      <button type="button" data-pin-color="black" aria-pressed="false" title="black"><span style="background:#000000"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="white" aria-pressed="false" title="white"><span style="background:#ffffff"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="red" aria-pressed="true" title="red"><span style="background:#e8202a"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="dark orange" aria-pressed="false" title="dark orange"><span style="background:#ff8c00"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="bright green" aria-pressed="false" title="bright green"><span style="background:#30f030"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="magenta" aria-pressed="false" title="magenta"><span style="background:#ff00ff"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="gray" aria-pressed="false" title="gray"><span style="background:#808080"></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-pin-color="pink" aria-pressed="false" title="pink"><span style="background:#ff9ec8"></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="draw" hidden>
      <p class="create-note" data-draw="idle drawing">Drag on the ground to draw a line to grow things along.</p>
      <div data-draw="drawn" hidden>
        <p class="create-note">Grow along the line:</p>
        <div class="create-way">
          <button type="button" data-grow="hills">hills</button>
          <button type="button" data-grow="range">range</button>
          <button type="button" data-grow="cliff">cliff</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-draw="adjusting" hidden>
        <label>width <output id="growWidthOut"></output>
          <input id="growWidth" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
        </label>
        <label data-grown="hills range">height <output id="growHeightOut"></output>
          <input id="growHeight" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
        </label>
        <label data-grown="hills range">density <output id="growDensityOut"></output>
          <input id="growDensity" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
        </label>
        <label>noise <output id="growNoiseOut"></output>
          <input id="growNoise" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
        </label>
        <p class="create-note create-warn" id="growFlat" hidden>Not grown: the ground's flat across the whole line, so neither side is higher to rise on.</p>
        <p class="create-note" data-grown="cliff">The cliff gathers the rise the ground already has across the line, out to its width either side, into a step at the line, up to the side that's higher along most of it. It's taller where the ground rises more, none where it's flat or higher on the other side, and it eases out to nothing at its ends. Its face is shaded orange, the ground it takes the rise from lighter. The blue line floats at the height of its top.</p>
        <p class="create-note" data-grown="hills range">Width is the whole band. Dots are the peaks to grow, bigger for taller: tallest in the orange middle third, smaller across the middle two, low hills out to the yellow edge. The blue line floats at the height it aims for.</p>
        <div class="create-way">
          <button type="button" id="growBack">back</button>
          <button type="button" id="growGo">grow</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-draw="drawn adjusting" hidden>
        <div class="create-way">
          <button type="button" id="growThrow">throw the line away</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="create-note" data-draw="drawn adjusting" hidden>Drag again for another line. Enter grows, Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="growUndo" disabled>undo last growth</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="biomes" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click corners to draw an area of a biome. Click its first corner, double-click or press Enter to close it. Backspace takes the last corner back, and Esc throws it away.</p>
      <div class="create-swatches create-biomes" role="group" aria-label="biome">
        <button type="button" data-biome="plains" aria-pressed="true" title="plains"><span style="background:#a8c060"></span>plains</button>
        <button type="button" data-biome="forest" aria-pressed="false" title="forest"><span style="background:#2e7d32"></span>forest</button>
        <button type="button" data-biome="rocky" aria-pressed="false" title="rocky"><span style="background:#9e9488"></span>rocky</button>
        <button type="button" data-biome="swamp" aria-pressed="false" title="swamp"><span style="background:#56704a"></span>swamp</button>
      </div>
      <p class="create-note">Click an area or its outline to select it, and pick a biome to change it. Drag its corners, drag an edge to add a corner, and shift-click a corner to take it away. Click inside it to draw another area there, or outside to unselect it. Delete or backspace deletes it. Where areas overlap, the last drawn wins.</p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="biomesDelete">delete</button>
        <button type="button" id="biomesUndo">undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="water" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click corners to draw round a body of water. Click its first corner, double-click or press Enter to close it. It fills the ground inside lower than its level, which starts at the lowest ground round its outline. Backspace takes the last corner back, and Esc throws it away.</p>
      <div class="create-swatches create-biomes" role="group" aria-label="type of water">
        <button type="button" data-water="lake" aria-pressed="false" title="lake"><span style="background:#3a78b8"></span>lake</button>
        <button type="button" data-water="pond" aria-pressed="true" title="pond"><span style="background:#3c9aa6"></span>pond</button>
        <button type="button" data-water="swamp" aria-pressed="false" title="swamp pool"><span style="background:#6d7a3c"></span>swamp</button>
      </div>
      <label class="create-level">level <input type="number" id="waterLevel" step="0.5" disabled> ft</label>
      <p class="create-note">Click a body's outline or inside it to select it, then pick a type or type its level to change it. Drag its corners, drag an edge to add a corner, and shift-click a corner to take it away. Delete or backspace deletes it. The water shows a few seconds after a change.</p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="waterDelete">delete</button>
        <button type="button" id="waterUndo">undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="courses" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click corners from a stream's or river's source down to draw it. Double-click or press Enter to finish it, Backspace takes the last corner back, and Esc throws it away. Its channel's carved and its water's never higher than upstream. It's red till its end is in water or on another course.</p>
      <div class="create-swatches create-biomes" role="group" aria-label="type of course">
        <button type="button" data-course="stream" aria-pressed="true" title="stream"><span style="background:#5aa0d8"></span>stream</button>
        <button type="button" data-course="river" aria-pressed="false" title="river"><span style="background:#2f6bb0"></span>river</button>
      </div>
      <label class="create-level">width at its source <input type="number" id="courseStart" step="1" min="1" disabled> ft</label>
      <label class="create-level">width at its end <input type="number" id="courseEnd" step="1" min="1" disabled> ft</label>
      <label class="create-check" title="courses running into others widen them below, and courses fill low spots as pools; off, edits change only the course edited"><input type="checkbox" id="courseRipple" checked> ripple</label>
      <p class="create-note">Click a course to select it, then pick a type or type its widths to change it. Drag its corners, drag between them to add one, and shift-click a corner to take it away. Delete or backspace deletes it.</p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="coursesDelete">delete</button>
        <button type="button" id="coursesUndo">undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="measure" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click to start a ruler to the pointer, ticked at miles, quarter miles, 500, 100 and 10 ft, and click again to put it away. Drag to draw a circle, with its radius and area.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-config="path" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click where to start, then where to go, and it searches for the shortest way on foot, up slopes no steeper than 50°, swimming where it has to. The ground it's searched is tinted yellow near the start to red at its longest, blue where it swam. The way is drawn white walked and blue swum.</p>
      <p class="create-note" id="pathStatus"></p>
      <label>longest <output id="pathMostOut"></output>
        <input id="pathMost" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="694">
      </label>
      <label>speed <output id="pathSpeedOut"></output>
        <input id="pathSpeed" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="500">
      </label>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="pathAgain">search again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="object template slab stairs ramp" hidden>
      <label title="corners, objects, doors and windows snap to a grid on the floor or wall under the pointer, centered on it, or square to north on the ground; shift holds snapping off"><input type="checkbox" id="buildGrid"> snap to
        <select id="buildGridFt"><option value="0.5">6 in</option><option value="1">1 ft</option><option value="2" selected>2 ft</option><option value="4">4 ft</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <div data-config="pick" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click an object or slab to pick it, or drag a box round them. Shift picks more, or fewer. Drag picked things to move them, or drag the handles at their middle: the arrows and squares move them, and the ring turns them all about their middle, by 15° steps, or freely with shift. C and V turn them too, the up and down arrows raise and lower them, with shift further, and Delete deletes them.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <p class="create-note" id="pickedCount"></p>
      <label id="pickedScaleRow" hidden>size <output id="pickedScaleOut"></output>
        <input id="pickedScale" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
      </label>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="pickedDelete">delete</button>
        <button type="button" id="pickedCopy" title="copy what's picked, to paste with the template tool (ctrl+C)">copy</button>
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="makeTemplate">make template…</button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="pickedRaise" title="raise the walls picked, or cut them down, so their tops meet the underside of the floor or roof over them">extend up to surface</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="object" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Pick an object, then click the ground or a slab to place it. C and V turn it, [ and ] size it.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <div class="create-recent" id="recentObjects"></div>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="objectLibrary">library…</button>
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
      <label id="objectScaleRow" hidden>size <output id="objectScaleOut"></output>
        <input id="objectScale" type="range" min="0" max="1000">
      </label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" id="objectRandom" checked> turn at random</label>
    </div>
    <div data-config="template" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Pick a template, then click to place copies of its slabs and objects, its anchor on the grid at the ground's height. C and V turn it. Make templates with select.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <div class="create-recent" id="recentTemplates"></div>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="templateLibrary">library…</button>
        <button type="button" id="templatePaste" aria-pressed="false" title="place what was copied last (ctrl+V)">paste</button>
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="slab" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Drag to draw, starting on the ground or a slab. Floors and rooms are square to the way you look. Roof drags one eave, then move to where the other goes and click; a gable's ridge runs along them, and a shed rises from the first. Polygon clicks a floor's corners in turn, level with the first, and closes on the first again or Enter; Backspace takes the last back. Esc drops what's being drawn. Door and window: drag a hole's corners across a wall, and it's cut when you let go; a door goes down to the floor or ground. A click cuts one of the usual size.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="what to draw">
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="floor" aria-pressed="true">floor</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="wall" aria-pressed="false">wall</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="room" aria-pressed="false">room</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="roof" aria-pressed="false">roof</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="polygon" aria-pressed="false" title="click a floor's corners, closing it on the first">polygon</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="door" aria-pressed="false" title="click a wall to cut a door 4 ft wide and 7 tall in it, up from the floor or ground there">door</button>
        <button type="button" data-slab-mode="window" aria-pressed="false" title="click a slab to cut a window 3 ft square in it">window</button>
      </div>
      <label data-slab-only="floor wall room roof polygon">surface
        <span id="slabSurface" data-swatches title="surface" data-value="floorboards"></span>
      </label>
      <label data-slab-only="floor wall room roof polygon">thickness <input type="number" id="slabThickness" value="1" min="0.1" max="16" step="0.25"> ft</label>
      <label data-slab-only="wall room">height <input type="number" id="slabHeight" value="10" min="1" max="60" step="1"> ft</label>
      <label data-slab-only="room"><input type="checkbox" id="slabRoomRoof"> with a roof</label>
      <label data-slab-roof>roof
        <select id="slabRoof"><option>gable</option><option>hip</option><option>shed</option><option>flat</option></select>
      </label>
      <label data-slab-roof>pitch <input type="number" id="slabPitch" value="30" min="0" max="60" step="5">°</label>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="stairs" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Drag the bottom edge of the flight on the ground or a slab, then point where its top edge goes, on a slab or the ground, and click. With nothing there to point at, set it with the sliders and place it. Esc drops it, keeping the tool.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <label>surface
        <span id="stairSurface" data-swatches title="surface" data-value="stoneBlocks"></span>
      </label>
      <label>risers
        <span id="stairRisers" data-swatches title="risers" data-value="same" data-extra="same:same,open:open"></span>
      </label>
      <label>thickness <input type="number" id="stairThickness" value="1" min="0.1" max="16" step="0.25"> ft</label>
      <label>steps <input type="number" id="stairSteps" value="1" min="1" max="128" step="1" disabled>
        <input type="checkbox" id="stairStepsAuto" checked> about 7 in each</label>
      <label>width <output id="stairWidthOut"></output>
        <input id="stairWidth" type="range" min="0.5" max="40" step="0.5" value="4" disabled>
      </label>
      <label>run <output id="stairRunOut"></output>
        <input id="stairRun" type="range" min="0.5" max="64" step="0.5" value="8" disabled>
      </label>
      <label>height <output id="stairRiseOut"></output>
        <input id="stairRise" type="range" min="0.5" max="49" step="0.5" value="6" disabled>
      </label>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="stairPlace" disabled>place it</button>
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="ramp" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Drag the bottom edge of the ramp on the ground or a slab, then drag its top edge. Where the top edge starts sets the ramp's slope, and its end stays on that slope, so the top can be shifted along or narrower than the bottom. It can be no steeper than 50°. Snapping to slabs' edges joins a ramp to them. Esc drops it, keeping the tool.</p>
      <p class="create-note create-said" data-build-say></p>
      <label>surface
        <span id="rampSurface" data-swatches title="surface" data-value="flagstones"></span>
      </label>
      <label>thickness <input type="number" id="rampThickness" value="1" min="0.1" max="16" step="0.25"> ft</label>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" data-build-undo>undo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="select" hidden>
      <p class="create-note">Click a line or pin to select it, or drag a box round them. Shift selects more, or clicks fewer. Drag selected pins to move them. Double-click a pin to open it. Delete or backspace deletes what's selected.</p>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="marksDelete">delete</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="caveSelect entrance caveAdd" hidden>
      <label data-only="caveAdd">length <output id="planReachOut"></output> <span class="create-note">(scroll wheel)</span>
        <input id="planReach" type="range" step="4" value="32">
      </label>
      <div data-only="entrance">
        <label>network <select id="planNet"><option value="">new network</option></select></label>
        <div class="create-way">
          <input id="planNetName" type="text" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder="new network's name">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="planWhat" class="create-note"></p>
      <div class="create-rocks" role="group" aria-label="rock" data-rocks="plan">
        <button type="button" data-rock="0" aria-pressed="false" title="jagged"><span class="create-swatch"></span>jagged<kbd class="create-key">2</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="1" aria-pressed="false" title="smooth"><span class="create-swatch"></span>smooth<kbd class="create-key">3</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="2" aria-pressed="false" title="carved"><span class="create-swatch"></span>carved<kbd class="create-key">4</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="3" aria-pressed="false" title="mined"><span class="create-swatch"></span>mined<kbd class="create-key">5</kbd></button>
      </div>
      <div id="planPointDetails" hidden>
        <label>width <output id="planPoint-widthOut"></output>
          <input id="planPoint-width" type="range" step="2" value="18">
        </label>
        <label>height <output id="planPoint-heightOut"></output>
          <input id="planPoint-height" type="range" step="2" value="22">
        </label>
        <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="qualities">
          <button type="button" data-quality="twisty" aria-pressed="false" title="meanders left and right">twisty</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="very twisty" aria-pressed="false" title="meanders further">very twisty</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="bumpy" aria-pressed="false" title="its floor rises and dips">bumpy</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="ledges" aria-pressed="false" title="a shelf along one wall, ramping down to the floor">ledges</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="cluttered" aria-pressed="false" title="pillars, boulders and mounds left in the rock">cluttered</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="offshoots" aria-pressed="false" title="alcoves, and sometimes a side passage ending blind">offshoots</button>
          <button type="button" data-quality="switchbacks" aria-pressed="false" title="zigzags where it's too steep to walk">switchbacks</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="planEntranceDetails">
      <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="style">
        <button type="button" data-entrance-style="natural" aria-pressed="false" title="a round cave mouth">natural</button>
        <button type="button" data-entrance-style="mine" aria-pressed="false" title="a square mine entrance">mine</button>
      </div>
      <label>width <output id="planEntranceWidthOut"></output>
        <input id="planEntranceWidth" type="range" step="1" value="18">
      </label>
      <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="length">
        <button type="button" data-entrance-length="16" aria-pressed="false">16 ft</button>
        <button type="button" data-entrance-length="32" aria-pressed="false">32 ft</button>
        <button type="button" data-entrance-length="48" aria-pressed="false">48 ft</button>
        <button type="button" data-entrance-length="64" aria-pressed="false">64 ft</button>
      </div>
      <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="slope">
        <button type="button" data-entrance-slope="level" aria-pressed="false">level</button>
        <button type="button" data-entrance-slope="down" aria-pressed="false" title="down 1 ft in every 5">down</button>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="create-way" data-only="caveSelect">
        <button type="button" id="planDelete">delete</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="caveBlocks caveSculpt caveSmooth caveFlatten cavePaint" hidden>
      <div class="create-modes" role="group" aria-label="shape" data-only="caveSculpt">
        <button type="button" data-polish-shape="sphere" aria-pressed="false">sphere</button>
        <button type="button" data-polish-shape="cube" aria-pressed="false">cube</button>
        <button type="button" data-polish-shape="cylinder" aria-pressed="false">cylinder</button>
        <button type="button" data-polish-shape="box" aria-pressed="false" title="click two corners, then Enter">box</button>
      </div>
      <label data-not="caveBlocks">size <output id="polishSizeOut"></output>
        <input id="polishSize" type="range" step="1" value="2">
      </label>
      <div data-only="caveBlocks caveSculpt">
        <div class="create-rocks" role="group" aria-label="rock" data-rocks="fill">
        <button type="button" data-rock="same" aria-pressed="false" title="the rock around it">same<kbd class="create-key">1</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="0" aria-pressed="false" title="jagged"><span class="create-swatch"></span>jagged<kbd class="create-key">2</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="1" aria-pressed="false" title="smooth"><span class="create-swatch"></span>smooth<kbd class="create-key">3</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="2" aria-pressed="false" title="carved"><span class="create-swatch"></span>carved<kbd class="create-key">4</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="3" aria-pressed="false" title="mined"><span class="create-swatch"></span>mined<kbd class="create-key">5</kbd></button>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div data-only="cavePaint">
        <div class="create-rocks" role="group" aria-label="rock" data-rocks="paint">
        <button type="button" data-rock="0" aria-pressed="false" title="jagged"><span class="create-swatch"></span>jagged<kbd class="create-key">2</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="1" aria-pressed="false" title="smooth"><span class="create-swatch"></span>smooth<kbd class="create-key">3</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="2" aria-pressed="false" title="carved"><span class="create-swatch"></span>carved<kbd class="create-key">4</kbd></button>
        <button type="button" data-rock="3" aria-pressed="false" title="mined"><span class="create-swatch"></span>mined<kbd class="create-key">5</kbd></button>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-config="raise flatten smooth noise pools clear eraser" hidden>
      <div class="create-shapes" role="group" aria-label="shape" data-only="raise">
        <button type="button" data-shape="round" aria-pressed="true" title="round"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="round"></canvas></button>
        <button type="button" data-shape="steep" aria-pressed="false" title="steep sides"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="steep"></canvas></button>
        <button type="button" data-shape="peak" aria-pressed="false" title="peak"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="peak"></canvas></button>
        <button type="button" data-shape="cylinder" aria-pressed="false" title="cylinder, a hard edge"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="cylinder"></canvas></button>
        <button type="button" data-shape="mesa" aria-pressed="false" title="mesa"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="mesa"></canvas></button>
        <button type="button" data-shape="half" aria-pressed="false" title="half, turned with c and v"><canvas width="32" height="20" data-shape="half"></canvas></button>
      </div>
      <label>size <output id="brushSizeOut"></output>
        <input id="brushSize" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="400">
      </label>
      <label data-not="clear eraser pools">strength <output id="brushStrengthOut"></output>
        <input id="brushStrength" type="range" min="1" max="100" value="20">
      </label>
      <label id="brushAngleRow" hidden>angle <output id="brushAngleOut"></output>
        <input id="brushAngle" type="range" min="0" max="359" value="0">
      </label>
      <label data-only="raise">noise <output id="brushNoiseOut"></output>
        <input id="brushNoise" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0">
      </label>
      <label data-only="noise">grain <output id="brushGrainOut"></output>
        <input id="brushGrain" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="400">
      </label>
      <div class="create-way" role="group" aria-label="lumpy or craggy" data-only="noise">
        <button type="button" data-grain="lumpy" aria-pressed="true">lumpy</button>
        <button type="button" data-grain="craggy" aria-pressed="false">craggy</button>
      </div>
      <label data-only="pools">pools <output id="poolsCountOut"></output>
        <input id="poolsCount" type="range" min="1" max="40" value="8">
      </label>
      <label data-only="pools">pool size <output id="poolsSizeOut"></output>
        <input id="poolsSize" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="400">
      </label>
      <div class="create-way" role="group" aria-label="raise or lower" data-only="raise">
        <button type="button" data-way="raise" aria-pressed="true">raise</button>
        <button type="button" data-way="lower" aria-pressed="false">lower</button>
      </div>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="raise">Drag on the ground. Ctrl or cmd does the other way. [ and ] resize. c and v turn, with shift a little. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="flatten">Drag to pull the ground toward the height where you began. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="smooth">Drag to even the ground out. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="noise">Drag to roughen the ground. The lumps are the same each time, so going over it again makes them taller. Ctrl or cmd takes them out again. Grain is how big the lumps are, and big brushes can't go as fine. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="pools">Click or drag to dig small pools in the ground inside the ring and fill them with swamp water. They keep off steep ground, water and each other. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <div class="create-way" data-only="pools">
        <button type="button" id="poolsUndo" disabled>undo last pools</button>
      </div>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="eraser">Drag across lines to erase them. Erasing a line's middle leaves two lines. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
      <p class="create-note" data-only="clear">Drag to clear tiles away, back to empty sea: each tile whose middle is in the ring. [ and ] resize. Esc puts the tool down.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-config="marker eraser select pin" hidden>
      <div class="create-way">
        <button type="button" id="marksUndo">undo</button>
      </div>
      <p class="create-note">Lines and pins are kept with the world when you download it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</aside>
<footer id="bottom">
  <section class="create-info" aria-label="where you are">
    <dl>
      <dt>pointing at</dt><dd id="infoPoint">-</dd>
      <dt>horiz</dt><dd id="infoHoriz">-</dd>
      <dt>spot</dt><dd id="infoSpot" title="where the pointer meets the ground or a cave's rock: x, height, z, in feet">-</dd>
      <dt>height</dt><dd id="infoHeight">-</dd>
      <dt>ground</dt><dd id="infoGround">-</dd>
      <dt>facing</dt><dd id="infoFacing">-</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
  <section class="create-debug" id="debug" aria-label="debug" hidden>
    <div data-debug="frame" hidden>
      <dl>
        <dt>fps</dt><dd id="debugFps">-</dd>
        <dt>slowest</dt><dd id="debugSlowest">-</dd>
        <dt>draws</dt><dd id="debugDraws">-</dd>
      </dl>
      <dl>
        <dt class="create-debug-head" title="what the slowest frame spent its time on">slowest's</dt>
        <dt>move</dt><dd id="debugMove">-</dd>
        <dt>tools</dt><dd id="debugTool">-</dd>
        <dt>ground</dt><dd id="debugGround">-</dd>
        <dt>render</dt><dd id="debugRender">-</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div data-debug="ground" hidden>
      <dl>
        <dt class="create-debug-head">tiles drawn</dt>
        <dt title="in full">full</dt><dd id="debugFull">-</dd>
        <dt title="flat-shaded at cell scale">cells</dt><dd id="debugFine">-</dd>
        <dt title="from their renditions, a part a chunk">coarse</dt><dd id="debugCoarse">-</dd>
        <dt title="from their plates' renditions">plates</dt><dd id="debugPlates">-</dd>
      </dl>
      <dl>
        <dt title="how far off ground's drawn">reach</dt><dd id="debugReach">-</dd>
        <dt>hiding</dt><dd id="debugHidden">-</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div data-debug="builder" hidden>
      <dl>
        <dt>moving</dt><dd id="debugMoving">-</dd>
        <dt title="over the ground">up</dt><dd id="debugAbove">-</dd>
        <dt>tile</dt><dd id="debugTile">-</dd>
        <dt>plate</dt><dd id="debugPlate">-</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="create-show" aria-label="show">
    <fieldset>
      <legend>planning</legend>
      <label title="the grid"><input type="checkbox" id="showGrid" checked> grid</label>
      <label title="planning lines, outside planning"><input type="checkbox" id="showLines" checked> lines</label>
      <label title="planning lines as walls 100 ft high, outside planning"><input type="checkbox" id="showCurtains"> curtains</label>
      <label title="pins and their titles"><input type="checkbox" id="showPins" checked> pins</label>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>geo</legend>
      <label title="biome areas, and the ground but that nearest tinted by biome"><input type="checkbox" id="showBiomes"> biomes</label>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>debug</legend>
      <label title="frame rate, the slowest frame and what it spent its time on, and draw calls"><input type="checkbox" data-show-debug="frame"> frame</label>
      <label title="how many tiles are drawn how finely, and how far off"><input type="checkbox" data-show-debug="ground"> ground</label>
      <label title="how the builder's moving, and where"><input type="checkbox" data-show-debug="builder"> builder</label>
    </fieldset>
  </section>
</footer>
<div id="help" popover>
  <h2>Keys</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>T / G / Y / I</dt><dd>planning, geo, build or caves</dd>
    <dt>H J K L N M</dt><dd>pick a tool, as shown on its button</dd>
    <dt>W / S</dt><dd>run, fly or swim forward and back; flying and swimming, the way the camera looks, so look down to dive</dd>
    <dt>A / D</dt><dd>turn</dd>
    <dt>Q / E</dt><dd>strafe</dd>
    <dt>space</dt><dd>take off, then rise; in deep water, swim up</dd>
    <dt>F</dt><dd>fall; in deep water, swim down</dd>
    <dt>space space / F F / W W</dt><dd>double-tap and hold to go three times as fast up, down or forward</dd>
    <dt>F F standing</dt><dd>go down into the earth, a ghost in the rock till you fly up out of the ground</dd>
    <dt>left-drag</dt><dd>look around, or work the tool picked</dd>
    <dt>right-drag</dt><dd>turn, and look up or down</dd>
    <dt>wheel</dt><dd>zoom</dd>
    <dt>ctrl or cmd</dt><dd>work the tool the other way</dd>
    <dt>[ / ]</dt><dd>make the tool smaller or bigger</dd>
    <dt>C / V</dt><dd>turn the tool left or right, with shift a little</dd>
    <dt>Esc</dt><dd>drop the slab, stairs or ramp being drawn, or else put the tool down</dd>
    <dt>Delete</dt><dd>delete the selected lines, or the objects and slabs picked</dd>
    <dt>arrows up / down</dt><dd>raise or lower the objects and slabs picked, with shift further</dd>
    <dt>ctrl+Z</dt><dd>undo the last change to objects and slabs</dd>
    <dt>ctrl+C / ctrl+V</dt><dd>copy the objects and slabs picked, and paste them as a template</dd>
    <dt>1 2 3 4</dt><dd>show or hide full ground, cell chunks, tiles, plates</dd>
  </dl>
  <h2>Tools</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>manage</dt><dd>upload a world, download it with your changes, or start a new, empty one</dd>
    <dt>planning</dt><dd>mark the world up: the marker draws lines on the ground, in colors, widths and dashes, the eraser erases them, select picks them out to delete whole, pins hold notes, measure measures distances and circles, and path finds the shortest way on foot from one place to another, to find where ranges and cliffs can be crossed. Click a pin's head to open it</dd>
    <dt>build</dt><dd>place objects and templates, from the ones used lately or the library, draw floors, walls, rooms and roofs as slabs, draw stairs and ramps, and pick what's placed to move, turn, delete or make a template of</dd>
    <dt>caves</dt><dd>lay out and polish cave networks. The panel shows the network you're in, or were last in, and switches it between layout and polish. Select picks points and entrances to see or change them; place entrance, from above the ground, starts or joins a network; in layout, add lays passages out from inside, to where you look; in polish, blocks, sculpt, smooth, flatten and paint edit the rock by hand. Number keys pick the rock: 1 the rock around it, 2 to 5 jagged, smooth, carved and mined</dd>
    <dt>geo</dt><dd>shape the ground: raise and lower it with brushes of different shapes, flatten it, smooth it, draw lines to grow hills and mountain ranges along, draw areas of each biome, draw lakes, ponds and swamp pools, draw streams and rivers, and clear it away</dd>
  </dl>
</div>
